# scripts/checks/feature-tc-coverage.baseline
#
# Snapshot of features that were `status: complete` with fewer than four
# linked TCs at the moment ADR-072 landed. Listed feature IDs are exempt
# from the hard gate so the rule can be enforced on new work without
# blocking 92 features of pre-existing technical debt. Snapshot date:
# 2026-06-02.
#
# Maintenance:
#   - DO NOT add new entries. New features must be authored with >=4 TCs.
#   - REMOVE entries as the TC-author worker brings each feature up to
#     the floor and the script emits a "remove from baseline" diagnostic.
#   - When this file is empty, delete it and tighten the script to remove
#     the baseline branch.
#
# One feature ID per line. Blank lines and `#` comments are ignored.

